### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### Closira Enquiry Engine — API Test File (VS Code REST Client)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8000/health
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Create Enquiry — Pricing Question (should match pricing_question SOP)
POST http://localhost:8000/enquiry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Sarah Mitchell",
  "channel": "whatsapp",
  "message": "Hi, I wanted to know about your pricing plans."
}

###

### Create Enquiry — Booking (should match booking_enquiry SOP)
POST http://localhost:8000/enquiry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Amit Joshi",
  "channel": "email",
  "message": "Can you help me book an appointment for next Tuesday?"
}

###

### Create Enquiry — Complaint (should match complaint SOP)
POST http://localhost:8000/enquiry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Ravi Kumar",
  "channel": "call",
  "message": "I'm very unhappy with the service. This is terrible."
}

###

### Create Enquiry — After Hours (should match after_hours SOP)
POST http://localhost:8000/enquiry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Priya Sharma",
  "channel": "whatsapp",
  "message": "Are you open today? I think you might be closed on the weekend."
}

###

### Create Enquiry — No SOP Match (should auto-escalate)
POST http://localhost:8000/enquiry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Unknown User",
  "channel": "whatsapp",
  "message": "Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, nothing relevant here."
}

###

### Get Enquiry History (replace enq_XXXXXXXX with actual ID from above)
GET http://localhost:8000/enquiry/enq_XXXXXXXX/history
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Schedule Follow-up (replace enq_XXXXXXXX with actual ID)
POST http://localhost:8000/enquiry/enq_XXXXXXXX/followup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "delay_minutes": 30,
  "message_template": "Hi {customer_name}, following up on your enquiry!"
}

###

### Escalate Enquiry (replace enq_XXXXXXXX with actual ID)
POST http://localhost:8000/enquiry/enq_XXXXXXXX/escalate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Customer is demanding a manager and threatening to leave."
}

###

### ─── Error Cases ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Validation Error — Invalid Channel
POST http://localhost:8000/enquiry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Test User",
  "channel": "telegram",
  "message": "This should fail validation."
}

###

### Validation Error — Missing Fields
POST http://localhost:8000/enquiry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Test User"
}

###

### 404 — Non-existent Enquiry
GET http://localhost:8000/enquiry/enq_doesnotexist/history
Content-Type: application/json
